{"id":"dxa0Bm8m","slug":"veinminer-client","title":"VeinMiner Hotkey","description":"Veinminer Addon - Use a hotkey to veinmine with a dynamic crosshair & block highlighting","author":"Miraculixx","categories":["equipment","fabric","game-mechanics","neoforge","quilt","utility"],"display_categories":["equipment","fabric","game-mechanics","neoforge","quilt","utility"],"client_side":"required","server_side":"unsupported","project_type":"mod","downloads":73354101,"followers":566,"license":{"id":"LGPL-3.0-only","name":"GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 only"},"loaders":["fabric","neoforge","quilt"],"game_versions":["1.20.5","1.20.6","1.21","1.21.1","1.21.2","1.21.3","1.21.4","1.21.5","1.21.6","1.21.7","1.21.8","1.21.9","1.21.10","1.21.11","26.1","26.1.1","26.1.2","26.2","26.3"],"latest_version":"Qhmfbmjx","date_created":"2025-03-25T12:09:46.773478Z","date_modified":"2026-10-20T13:13:46.332604Z","updated":"2026-10-20T13:13:46.332604Z","color":4211517,"body":"[dono-badge](https://ko-fi.com/miraculixx/donate)\n[![veinminer-badge](/launcher-preview/bodies/dxa0Bm8m/0.webp)](https://modrinth.com/mod/veinminer)\n[![enchant-badge](/launcher-preview/bodies/dxa0Bm8m/1.webp)](https://modrinth.com/project/veinminer-enchantment)\n\n\n## ⛏️ Veinminer Hotkey\n\nAddon for the popular [Veinminer](https://modrinth.com/project/veinminer) mod/plugin that adds a custom hotkey, veinmine preview & pattern control. As long as this addon is installed, veinmining is only possible with the hotkey pressed (still respecting block rules and settings).\n\n**Hold Hotkey**: `Y` or `Z` (can be changed in client controls, default is depending on your key layout)<br>\n**Toggle Hotkey**: `unbound` (bind in client controls)\n\n## ⚠ Important\n[**Veinminer**](https://modrinth.com/project/veinminer) needs to be installed on the server too for this addon to work! If playing in single-player, install it on your client too.<br>\nWorks together with the [enchantment addon](https://modrinth.com/project/veinminer-enchantment) if installed.\n\n![showcase](/launcher-preview/bodies/dxa0Bm8m/2.webp)\n\n## ⚙ Settings\nPattern selection can be changed by holding the hotkey and **scrolling** up/down.<br>\nAdditionally holding **shift** allows changing the mining depth/width.\n\n**Pattern Config Hotkey**: `O` (configure, add, remove patterns to your liking. Accessible via mod menu as well)\nsettings ui preview\n\n---\n\n> **Affordable** Servers? In this time?! Clicking below **supports me** and saves you **10%** + 2 Days **free** ♥️\n> [](https://voltra.gg/r/miraculixx) <br>\n> #AD - Your support helps to keep this project alive :)\n\n---\n\nThe server can configure client behavior with the following options. The client mod will automatically disable itself if the server does not have Veinminer installed.\n\n**Command**: `/veinminer settings client ...`\n\n|           Setting           |                             Description                             | Default |\n|:---------------------------:|:-------------------------------------------------------------------:|:-------:|\n|           `allow`           |               If the use of the client mod is allowed               |  true   |\n| `translucentBlockHighlight` |       If block highlighting should be visible through blocks        |  true   |\n|      `allowAllBlocks`       | If hotkey user can veinmine every block (respecting other settings) |  false  |\n","published":"2025-03-25T12:09:46.773478Z","additional_categories":[],"issues_url":null,"source_url":"https://github.com/MiraculixxT/Veinminer","wiki_url":null,"discord_url":"https://dc.mutils.net/","donation_urls":[{"platform":"Ko-fi","url":"https://ko-fi.com/miraculixx"}],"team":[{"username":"Miraculixx","role":"Owner","avatar":"/launcher-preview/avatars/Miraculixx.webp"}],"versions_total":53,"gallery":[{"url":"/launcher-preview/galleries/dxa0Bm8m/0.webp","featured":true,"title":"Banner","description":null,"created":"2025-03-25T13:36:43.196845Z"},{"url":"/launcher-previe